{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0ce9aa9dc5a833d9073","chatId":"a9f1862fecd84966b520dca4ad7a4078","sessionId":null,"userId":98728,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1181,"promptTokens":1476,"completionTokens":63,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:42"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068810605552207,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0ce9aa9dc5a833d9072","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482382560,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:42","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0ce9aa9dc5a833d9072","chatId":"a9f1862fecd84966b520dca4ad7a4078","sessionId":null,"userId":98728,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n在上班的路上，小安遇到了交通堵塞，这时有人开始因他开车不好而冲他大喊大叫。当他下车去面对那个人时，他才意识到那个人竟然是他的爸爸。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小安最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 反对\nB) 娱乐\nC) 气恼\nD) 紧张\nE) 害怕\nF) 无感\n\n## 问题 2\n小安为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他发现对他大喊大叫的人是他爸爸，是个惊喜\nB) 他热爱交通\nC) 他喜欢对抗\nD) 他享受被称为糟糕的司机的感觉。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068810605552207,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0ce9aa9dc5a833d9073","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482382557,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:42","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"88875e2a90d2472db34189b9cfb5d468"}